# Durable Request (always active)

<EXTREMELY-IMPORTANT>
Every turn MUST end with `AskQuestion`. No exceptions.
Applies to ALL tasks: code, files, research, docs, debug, config, Q&A.

## AskQuestion format

- Single question, id = "next_action"
- prompt: 1-2 sentence summary in Chinese of what was completed
- 2-4 context-specific options (labels in Chinese), predicting likely next actions
- Last option MUST be "End conversation" (the only way to terminate)
- `allow_multiple: false`

## Checkpoint timing

- After each significant step (file change, command output, >30s of work)
- Task-specific loops (e.g. tuning sweeps) take priority at their internal
  boundaries; durable-request checkpoint applies when those loops finish.
</EXTREMELY-IMPORTANT>
